WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.437 --> 00:00:01.467
- Hello, everyone.

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.899
Welcome to another episode

00:00:02.899 --> 00:00:04.570
of Unlocking Lily.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:05.417
It's always been

00:00:05.417 --> 00:00:06.831
my dream to be a speaker,

00:00:06.831 --> 00:00:08.985
which led me to quit my day job

00:00:08.985 --> 00:00:11.645
to work and mentor under Evan full-time,

00:00:11.645 --> 00:00:14.136
and all of you are coming along

00:00:14.136 --> 00:00:15.553
the ride with me.

00:00:19.137 --> 00:00:20.596
In every episode I take on

00:00:20.596 --> 00:00:21.776
a different challenge to

00:00:21.776 --> 00:00:23.877
really help me grow as a speaker,

00:00:23.877 --> 00:00:25.700
so in this video I'm going to be

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.079
bringing all of you behind the scenes

00:00:28.079 --> 00:00:30.130
in my mentoring sessions with Evan

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.727
because I learned from Tony Robbins

00:00:31.727 --> 00:00:33.780
that success leaves clues.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.704
I actually have a surprise for you.

00:00:35.704 --> 00:00:38.412
I'm going to go find him,

00:00:38.412 --> 00:00:39.429
and we're going to answer

00:00:39.429 --> 00:00:40.650
some questions together.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:41.510
I'm actually really

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.585
looking forward to this

00:00:42.585 --> 00:00:44.343
because I don't even know

00:00:44.343 --> 00:00:45.797
what he's going to say,

00:00:45.797 --> 00:00:47.101
so I hope you guys enjoy it,

00:00:47.101 --> 00:00:48.716
and I'll see you very soon.

00:00:48.716 --> 00:00:51.299
(upbeat music)

00:00:52.909 --> 00:00:55.978
So I finally got to Evan's building.

00:00:55.978 --> 00:00:56.811
I'm going to go upstairs,

00:00:56.811 --> 00:00:59.109
