00:01:02.659 --> 00:01:03.845
I actually don't know the answers,

00:01:03.845 --> 00:01:05.323
so we'll see, we'll see how it goes.

00:01:05.323 --> 00:01:06.427
It's going to be fun.

00:01:06.427 --> 00:01:07.260
- What are we doing, Lily?

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:08.093
