00:05:36.326 --> 00:05:37.463
- Enough in class, okay.

00:05:37.463 --> 00:05:38.296
- Enough in class.

00:05:38.296 --> 00:05:39.823
- Okay, okay.

00:05:39.823 --> 00:05:41.241
- Then you said to me

00:05:41.241 --> 00:05:43.061
