00:05:46.013 --> 00:05:47.180
- Right, okay.

00:05:48.034 --> 00:05:49.575
- I couldn't figure out why that

00:05:49.575 --> 00:05:51.542
was a problem even.

00:05:51.542 --> 00:05:52.481
- Okay, okay.

00:05:52.481 --> 00:05:54.369
