00:05:54.369 --> 00:05:55.642
was such an issue.

00:05:55.642 --> 00:05:56.475
- Okay.

00:05:56.475 --> 00:05:57.983
- Isn't it good not to be relatable?

00:05:57.983 --> 00:05:58.816
- Okay.

00:05:58.816 --> 00:06:00.345
- Isn't it good to be an inspiration?

00:06:00.345 --> 00:06:01.178
- Okay.

00:06:01.178 --> 00:06:02.833
- So that's what I was thinking

00:06:02.833 --> 00:06:03.833
at the time,

00:06:05.148 --> 00:06:06.900
and then it took a while.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.546
I think it like took a few weeks,

00:06:08.546 --> 00:06:10.345
or even months to realize

00:06:10.345 --> 00:06:11.620
what was actually going on.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:12.559
- Okay.

00:06:12.559 --> 00:06:14.766
