00:06:18.399 --> 00:06:20.798
you know, why am I unrelatable?

00:06:20.798 --> 00:06:23.548
I try to put myself in a very ...

00:06:25.376 --> 00:06:27.497
On a platform and I try to be

00:06:27.497 --> 00:06:29.831
